      "content": "dude 911?? that seems like a lot overkill for just being tired. im not even in pain, it just feels like i had a really long day and my arm is just heavy. i don't want to go to the hospital and waste everyone's time if i'm just burnt out. can i just take an extra strong sleeping pill and sleep it off? would that be fine?",
